Subject: [PATCH 1580/3799] soh: rename func_80A90E28 -> EnKakasi3_ReturnToRest

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: stops the dance animation and eases the scarecrow's three rotation axes back to the pose it was spawned with; every non-dancing action calls it each frame. The twin of EnKakasi_ReturnToRest.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kakasi3/z_en_kakasi3.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
